---
title: "vestingRelease (High Level Sale Customer Journey)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: investor requests vested token release
    q_check_vesting --> q_get_schedule: vestingAddress[investor] != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_get_schedule --> q_calc_releasable: load vesting schedule
    q_calc_releasable --> q_check_amount: releasableAmount = vestedAmount - releasedAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_release: releasableAmount > 0
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_nothing: releasableAmount = 0
    q_revert_nothing --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_release --> q_update_released: transfer releasableAmount to investor
    q_update_released --> [*]: releasedAmount += releasableAmount

    note right of q_calc_releasable
        INV-001: Vested amount monotonically increases over time
        INV-002: releasedAmount <= vestedAmount at all times
        INV-003: Tokens only released according to vesting schedule (TGE or time-based)
    end note
